<title>MEXICO: Santander Mexicano takes new head from Accival.</title>
<headline>Santander Mexicano takes new head from Accival.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banco Santander on Monday said it named Marcos Martinez as director general of Grupo Financiero Santander Mexicano.</p>
<p>Prior to the posting, Martinez was director general of Banamex Acciones y Valores (Accival), the brokerage unit of Grupo Financiero Banamex-Accival.</p>
<p>Directly under him at Santander Mexicano will be Juan Arenado, director of Banco Santander Mexicano, and Miguel Alvarez del Rio, director of Santander Investment Mexico.</p>
<p>((-- Henry Tricks, Mexico City newsroom +525 728-9560))</p>
